[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948587012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2948587012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2948587012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vv94E","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T09:05:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T11:01:31Z","body":"I've found out the CPU/GPU times reported at the end of the recording are only for the RenderingServer without including encoding times. So I've added encoding time information to the report by measuring the time it takes to run `write_frame`, and also `write_end` since it writes the last frame in `MovieWriterOGV`.\r\n\r\nIn my tests with a production build, with the default settings (speed `4`), OGV is as fast as MJPEG. After repeating the tests several times, OGV gets slightly faster while MJPEG gets slightly slower. File write times are measured together with the encoding time so they might cause some variance. In a debug build, the OGV encoding is a bit slower, and no change in MJPEG encoding.\r\n\r\nChoosing speed `3` is slower but gives a good improvement in compression. It offers the best speed-compression ratio.\r\n\r\nUsing CBR with a target bitrate equal to the mean bitrate of the VBR file for equivalent compression takes almost the same time as VBR. It's even slower at speed `1`. This setting might be unnecessary.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2948587012/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950064273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2950064273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2950064273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v1miR","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T18:14:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T18:14:42Z","body":"> Using CBR with a target bitrate equal to the mean bitrate of the VBR file for equivalent compression takes almost the same time as VBR. It's even slower at speed 1. This setting might be unnecessary.\r\n\r\nI agree, I suggest removing the CBR setting if we can't find a good use case for it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950064273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950558446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2950558446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2950558446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v3fLu","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T19:44:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T19:47:00Z","body":"Thanks for all the suggestions, and for saving me from my struggles when writing documentation.\r\n\r\nI've removed the `video_bitrate` setting, renumbered the speed labels to use the real value instead of being off by one, and capitalized the OGV label (I was hoping for something like this to exist :) ).\r\n\r\nAnd rebased it on top of the current master, now with Theora 1.2.0.\r\n\r\nI forgot to mention it before but I'm using `oggz-validate` to check the generated OGV files. At first, it reported errors for Ogg pages with decreasing timestamps and the lack of end of stream markers. Now the generated files are clean.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2950558446/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2951113576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2951113576","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2951113576,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v5mto","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T22:46:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T22:46:20Z","body":"I've put everything in one commit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2951113576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954316089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2954316089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2954316089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wF0k5","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T22:55:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T23:08:00Z","body":"I've tried to address the issues, although I have doubts about the inclusion of CC-BY-SA 3.0 code.\r\n\r\nI've made a few minor changes to the `rgb2yuv` that could improve performance slightly and make the code simpler. Should I add a comment to the file about this?\r\n\r\nI've added a check for the video dimensions because the encoding won't work if they aren't even. Since `MovieWriter` doesn't check the return value from `write_begin`, when there's an error, it will still call `write_frame`  as if nothing happened and more error messages will be displayed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954316089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959308207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2959308207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2959308207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wY3Wv","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T13:40:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T13:40:32Z","body":"> I notice that, unlike what I might have suggested before, `--movie-writer` seems to be exposed in non-editor builds (export templates). I don't know if it actually works that way, but that means that with the changes done to only include the theora encoder in editor builds, OGV won't be available as a format for runtime movie encoding.\r\n\r\nI didn't think to check it out. It made sense that it was editor-only.\r\n\r\n> I think it's an appropriate tradeoff for now, and we can reconsider it if there's significant demand and the binary size impact is not too big.\r\n\r\nDon't hesitate to ask me if you change your mind now or later, it's easy to revert.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959308207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959605076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#issuecomment-2959605076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107188","id":2959605076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wZ_1U","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T15:01:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T15:01:17Z","body":"Thanks! Great work :tada: ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2959605076/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]